    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54788bd13f124dcf7a916044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――嘿嘿。比赛也好地方偶像也好，我都会认真地去努力做哦！\n训练员也认真地陪着我吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a1b1839f5928515adbaf7cea5b5fc7691e9e1b2b1eca179c0e10245b7c2e2ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
