    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6810310f29e445fe0771d08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓“多项目竞技大赛”是特雷森学园举办的校内竞赛。\n这是备受瞩目的竞赛，许多校外人士也会来观战──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12d5e9875480dfd4d723818041fe7fc5410e5ea73c29b4045cec174ad95c63e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
