      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有训练员帮忙监督会更事半功倍对吧？\n虽然监督我这种赛马娘，对你而言或许是大材小用就是了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f65339c9e5df27174805ec22f32ec9743680c4f98024e4b727d338674028eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
